  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "David Hall Marshall was an American motor dealer whose Bondy's businesses included Ford, Lincoln, Nissan, Toyota and Kubota franchises. His wife Renate's family established the dealership that he later owned. Born in Panama City, Florida, he moved to Dothan in 1982 and spent his working life in the automobile trade.",
    "html": "<p>David Hall Marshall was an American motor dealer whose Bondy's businesses included Ford, Lincoln, Nissan, Toyota and Kubota franchises. His wife Renate's family established the dealership that he later owned. Born in Panama City, Florida, he moved to Dothan in 1982 and spent his working life in the automobile trade.</p>\r\n",
